eproduce historical values of Vmin and Pspill with an average model error (RMSE) of 1.4\,Mm3 per 30\,d (19.4 cfs) and 25.4\,mm (1 in.), corresponding to 49\,\% and 37\,\% of mean observed values, respectively. Although these predictive indices could be used by governance entities to support local water management, careful consideration of baseline conditions used as a basis for prediction is necessary.},
